{"id":"4014995259092536228","query":"concert","source_queries":["concert"],"text":"Years ago I bought tickets for The Rolling Stones concert in Minneapolis and I got them from Stub Hub as Ticketmaster was playing their game where 90% of the tickets are automatically gone the second they go online for sale. Anyways time goes by & I had the tickets in my Apple wallet so thought everything was ok, then something came up & couldn’t attend the concert. I used Stub Hub to sell the tickets to someone else.","username":"greg.peterson.9404","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@greg.peterson.9404/post/De4IOpxFouk","timestamp":"2026-10-24T12:25:54Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","is_reply":true,"relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["concert"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-10-24T12:37:30.157777443Z","first_seen_at":"2026-10-24T12:37:36.242521Z","last_seen_at":"2026-10-24T12:37:36.242521Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_4f03ae8c3a578038","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
